  "body": "Pretty as a picture and privately positioned on its own freehold title this gorgeous, weatherboard home delivers all the comforts of modern, easy-care living in a beautiful lifestyle location.\r\n\r\nGlorious coastal reserve lands and walking tracks are at your door, providing spectacular surroundings for you and your dog to safely wander and explore daily.\r\n\r\nInside the expansive open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows directly into the private, fully fenced rear garden, which is perfect for catching the afternoon sun and relaxing outdoors.\r\n\r\nTwo generous double bedrooms, a beautifully appointed modern bathroom and the convenience of internal entry from the generous single garage add to the ease and comfort of living.\r\n\r\nThis property is an absolute delight offering modern convenience and ease of living in a wonderful lifestyle location \r\n\r\nThere is a lot to love at 33 Cape Cod Drive, our owner has relocated to be closer to family offering immediate possession if so required",
